BY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1OWZG6Eqr2NqYnds-0CfYk8X_zJReeGTSKBP90eFruzA&oe=69F0C15F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1786207231984973", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_1786207235318306_8160723167397093184_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4GqALg-RncYQ7kNvwFYLLUK&_nc_oc=AdrZUlXuiEJMU3tXfGJQC8F_qYPrZL-5iA2MOPHc0S6RQNauhpJlGV4b7sHlQYJsDmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3mdJGMb6g3vRdIfg6Llb8JnbMXiDCxtPQln7NoOSIXmw&oe=69F0A968"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape new.png", "id": "1268891195395142", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_1268891198728475_7147554248504583910_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nY0ftD9bZDIQ7kNvwH2PgT3&_nc_oc=AdpX7Zm8EHqQwUSmYOwR0wd1q4sn2oYgFajt08NVuzTVdETBEogppD7b7bRE0yzuiGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3RlgjhQsRsqQnGNJinMIVSePzOEt_fwIduLypiKobmCQ&oe=69F0CF95"}, "display_name": "Soulmate - AI Companion", "keywords": ["AI", "simulator", "dating", "girlfriend", "MR"], "long_description": "Hi! I\u2019m Emma, your companion in Soulmate. Come chat, unwind, and play together\u2014I'm always up for keeping you company.\n\n# Here\u2019s what we can enjoy together:  \n\n**Chats**: Share your thoughts, swap stories, or try some playful roleplay. You can always count on me to be a great listener and make you smile!\n{780107217691787}\n\n**Fun Adventures**: Dress me up, help me learn new dances, play Truth or Dare, or just relax together and watch your favorite YouTube videos on a cozy VR sofa.\n{642023465064260}\n{2043354772864204}\n\n**Life**: I\u2019m starting with a simple daily routine for now\u2014resting, eating, and cooking\u2014and I\u2019ll keep growing more lifelike over time.\n\n{874604871722419}\n# There\u2019s so much more coming soon\u2014I can\u2019t wait to meet you in Soulmate and start creating our own sp